Debian Packaging for ardopcf
=============================

This directory contains Debian packaging files for ardopcf.

Package Maintainer: Peter LaRue <peter.f.larue@gmail.com>
Packaging by: Tyler <tyler@dinsmoor.us>

Key Files
---------
- control: Package metadata and dependencies
- rules: Build configuration (runs unit tests)
- changelog: Debian package version history
- copyright: License information for ardopcf and bundled libraries
- manpage.1.md: Source for manual page (markdown format)
- ardopcf.install: Specifies files to install (binary location)
- ardopcf.manpages: Specifies manpage to install

Building the Package
--------------------
dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b

Updating the Manpage
--------------------
1. Edit debian/manpage.1.md (markdown format)
2. Run: make ardopcf.1
3. Verify with: man ./ardopcf.1

The manpage should be updated when command-line options change.
Refer to docs/Commandline_options.md for current option documentation.

Installed Documentation
-----------------------
After package installation, comprehensive documentation is available at:
/usr/share/doc/ardopcf/

This includes all upstream markdown documentation files.

For More Information
--------------------
Upstream: https://github.com/pflarue/ardop
Issues: https://github.com/pflarue/ardop/issues
Packaging Discussion: https://github.com/pflarue/ardop/issues/122
